x('isle-of-arran','Isle of Arran','Scotland','GB','British Isles',['four-five','week'],['islands','nature','mountains','relax'],['easy','balanced','adventure'],[3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10],'A compressed Scotland of peaks, coast and one ferry crossing.','Arran offers island calm and mountain choice in a scale that suits four days without constant relocation.',['Choose Goatfell or a lower route for your energy.','Circle part of the coast by bus or bike.','Visit a village, distillery or castle on the slower day.'],'Arran cheese, oatcakes and local whisky.','Ferry disruption is possible; protect onward connections with slack.','https://www.visitarran.com/'),
x('arles-camargue','Arles & the Camargue','France','FR','France & Benelux',['four-five','week'],['culture','nature','architecture','weird'],['easy','balanced'],[3,4,5,6,9,10,11],'Roman stone opening into wetlands and white horizons.','Arles links concentrated ancient architecture with the Camargue’s unusual flat, bird-rich landscape.',['Walk the Roman monuments as part of the city.','Spend time with the museums and Van Gogh context.','Use one full day for Camargue wetlands.'],'Gardianne de taureau and fougasse.','The Camargue is dispersed and exposed; a car or guided outing helps.','https://www.arlestourisme.com/en/'),
x('kefalonia','Kefalonia','Greece','GR','Greece',['week'],['islands','sun','nature','relax'],['easy','balanced'],[5,6,7,8,9,10],'Mountain-backed coves on an island that needs a week.','Kefalonia combines Ionian water with inland height and villages spaced far enough apart to reward one steady base.',['Choose one half of the island.','Visit a cave or mountain viewpoint between beach days.','Stay into evening at a harbour village.'],'Kefalonian meat pie and local Robola wine.','Roads are winding and distances add up; avoid daily island crossings.','https://www.visitgreece.gr/islands/ionian-islands/kefalonia/'),
x('brittany-coast','Brittany Coast','France','FR','France & Benelux',['week'],['nature','food','relax','romantic'],['easy','balanced'],[3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10],'Granite headlands, tidal drama and butter as infrastructure.','Brittany is a romantic slow coast trip with walking, seafood and towns shaped by the Atlantic rather than resort logic.',['Choose one coastal section as a base.','Walk part of the coast path.','Give a market town and crêperie an unhurried day.'],'Galettes, oysters and kouign-amann.','Tides and weather strongly shape coastal plans; consult local guidance.','https://www.brittanytourism.com/'),
x('peak-district','Peak District','England','GB','British Isles',['four-five','week'],['nature','charming','relax','adventure'],['easy','balanced'],[3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10],'Stone villages between green dales and gritstone edges.','The Peak District handles mixed energy well: gentle valley walks, sharper ridges and pub-centred villages.',['Pick either a limestone dale or gritstone edge day.','Base in one village.','Use a market town for the weather-proof afternoon.'],'Bakewell pudding, oatcakes and local ale.','Popular trailheads fill early; public transport works on selected routes.','https://www.peakdistrict.gov.uk/'),
x('peloponnese','Nafplio & the Argolid','Greece','GR','Greece',['four-five','week'],['romantic','culture','sun','food'],['easy','balanced'],[2,3,4,5,6,9,10,11],'A neoclassical harbour with ancient sites in reserve.','Nafplio is a romantic Greek base where seaside evenings balance substantial archaeological days.',['Circle Nafplio’s harbour and neoclassical lanes.','Climb Palamidi at a sensible hour.','Choose Mycenae or Epidaurus for one focused history day.'],'Orange-based sweets, local olive oil and seafood.','Nearby sites are dispersed; arrange transport rather than stacking both casually.','https://www.visitgreece.gr/mainland/peloponnese/nafplio/'),
x('luxembourg-ardennes','Luxembourg Ardennes','Luxembourg','LU','France & Benelux',['four-five','week'],['nature','charming','hidden','relax'],['easy','balanced'],[3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10],'Forested river bends and castles beyond the capital commute.','The Luxembourg Ardennes make a quiet walking break with small towns and woodland rather than metropolitan polish.',['Choose a section of the Éislek trail network.','Visit one castle town.','Use train and bus links where they suit the route.'],'Gromperekichelcher and regional beer.','Trail stages and rural services need modest advance planning.','https://www.visitluxembourg.com/place/region-eislek')
